WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.359
If you are unsure where you are, pause. You can get help.

2
00:00:03.359 --> 00:00:06.541
Stop in a safe, public place. You do not need to rush.

3
00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:10.783
Look for a staffed information desk, uniformed worker, or trusted adult.

4
00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:14.554
Say, I need help finding my way. You can show a trusted contact.

5
00:00:14.554 --> 00:00:17.913
Stay in the public place while you call someone you know.

6
00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:22.273
If you feel unsure, ask staff to stay nearby. Do not go somewhere private.

7
00:00:22.273 --> 00:00:27.780
Asking for help was a sensible choice. Stay safe and take your time.
